Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.50,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,300)}¿Tu cliente te dice\N«me lo tengo que pensar»?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Si un cliente te dice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.03,0:00:02.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}«me lo tengo que pensar»,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:03.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}no intentes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:04.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}convencerle todavía.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.57,0:00:05.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Yo, de entrada,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:06.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}no le diría nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:07.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Le dejaría
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.31,0:00:08.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}que terminara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:09.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Porque muchas veces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:11.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}ese «me lo tengo que pensar»
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.29,0:00:12.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}no es la objeción real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:14.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Pero muchos closers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:15.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}escuchan esa frase
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:16.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}y siempre cometen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}el mismo error.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.55,0:00:19.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Se lanzan a rebatirla
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.10,0:00:20.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}sin saber ni por qué
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:21.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}el cliente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:22.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}se lo está diciendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:24.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Pero espera un momento.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Yo siempre digo:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:26.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}¿Cómo vas a resolver
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.39,0:00:27.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}una objeción
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.25,0:00:28.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}que todavía no conoces?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:30.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Puede que no tenga dinero,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:32.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}puede que no hayas generado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:34.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}la suficiente confianza
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:35.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}o puede simplemente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:37.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}que no hayas conectado con él.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Así que, si después de escucharle,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:41.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}sigue sin saber
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:42.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}qué le está frenando,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:44.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}simplemente pregúntale:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:45.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}«¿Qué es lo que todavía
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.91,0:00:46.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}no tienes claro?»
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:47.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Y después,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:49.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}cállate y escucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:50.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Resolver objeciones
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.79,0:00:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}no consiste en memorizar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}frases para cada momento.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:00:56.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Consiste en entender
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}qué está frenando realmente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:00:59.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}al cliente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.31,0:01:00.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}en este momento.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.47,0:01:01.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}Comenta «OBJECIONES»
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.62,0:01:02.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}si quieres que hablemos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.93,0:01:03.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,90,\fscx100\fscy100)}de la tarea.
